    "hnl_trusted": {
      "type": "hnl-trusted",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "B2C & B2B - Australia-wide",
        "h1": "Trusted Hook and Loop Supplier for B2C & B2B Customers",
        "p1": "Proudly serving both B2C and B2B customers across Australia, we focus on quality products that work in real-world conditions. Every product offered at HooknLoop.com.au is carefully selected based on material quality, performance testing, and long-term reliability.",
        "h2": "Wholesale, Bulk & Discounted Hook and Loop Supplies",
        "p2": "With a large range of fasteners, tapes, straps and accessories held in stock, we offer competitive pricing for retail, trade and commercial buyers. Buy hook and loop tape by the roll, in bulk, or at wholesale rates - with volume discounts on larger orders.",
        "cta_label": "Read more",
        "cta_link": "/pages/customer-service",
        "image_alt": "Hook-and-loop tape beside a map of Australia and HooknLoop delivery boxes on a pallet",
        "proof_score": "4.87 / 5",
        "proof_text": "Serving B2C & B2B across Australia",
        "more_copy": "<p>We stock a complete range of fastening products, providing both globally recognised and cost-effective options in one place. From regular and temporary use to heavy-duty fastening, our solutions perform across a wide range of applications.</p><p>Our range includes adhesive-backed tape, sew-on rolls, sticky dots, self-gripping hook and loop fasteners, and straps. For mounting items, organising cables, securing signage, arranging displays, and accomplishing textile or upholstery projects with finesse, our products are perfect buy.</p><p>For premium fastening products that stick securely and stay in place for a long time, hooknloop.com.au is your destination. Our adhesive fasteners are suitable for fabric, walls, plastic, metal, wood, and other common surfaces. We have adhesive hook and loop fasteners in varied strengths, widths, and lengths to match your needs for various surfaces and settings.</p><p>We also have our sew-on options that deliver durability and flexibility for textile use without relying on adhesives.</p><p>The selection of the right fastener depends on the factor- how and where it will be used. At HooknLoop.com.au, we help customers make informed decisions by matching the correct product to the intended application.</p>"
      }
    },
